---
/**
 * Font Preload Component
 *
 * Preloads critical fonts to improve LCP and prevent FOUT.
 * Include this in the <head> of your layouts.
 */
---

<!-- Preload critical fonts for better performance -->
<link
  rel="preload"
  href="/fonts/Geist-Variable.woff2"
  as="font"
  type="font/woff2"
  crossorigin="anonymous"
/>
<!--
  EB Garamond powers every heading, which is above the fold on all pages, so the
  latin subset is preloaded to avoid a flash of fallback serif. The latin-ext
  subset (Croatian diacritics) is left to load on demand: it is larger and the
  browser only fetches it for pages whose headings actually contain those
  characters. Geist Mono is not preloaded either — it is used sparingly.
-->
<link
  rel="preload"
  href="/fonts/EBGaramond-600-latin.woff2"
  as="font"
  type="font/woff2"
  crossorigin="anonymous"
/>
